{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.poster.avif?t=1754068373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.webm?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blackout</strong> is a hardcore co-op shooter set in the Earth Federation, now overrun by special infected creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From secret laboratories to deep underground high-speed subway stations, you are deployed as near-future special forces to key Federation facilities.   <br>Leave no infected behind\u2014eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4-Player Co-op Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/29bc7b6d693765da434bf2529105506f.poster.avif?t=1754068373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/29bc7b6d693765da434bf2529105506f.webm?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One mistake can mean total annihilation. Teamwork is the only solution. Form a squad of 1 to 4 players and sweep through zones controlled by the infected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous high-risk operations await you and your team. Complete every mission across a vast range of objectives. Unlock sealed routes and enter hidden, uncontrollable areas.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Varied Combat Zones and Tactical Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.poster.avif?t=1754068373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.webm?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/fcd4d933765d05f686b33b7176eb3c89.mp4?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you handle your weapon will determine your squad\u2019s survival. Choose from a variety of weapons suited to the situation and take control of each zone in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to shifting patterns of infection and dynamic environments. Use a wide array of tactical gear to break through unpredictable threats head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/5685f8e7d4399bca7966c32eb06ffec4.poster.avif?t=1754068373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/5685f8e7d4399bca7966c32eb06ffec4.webm?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870010?t=1754068373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870010?t=1754068373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/b3e8029123041c5d9942a817da5c7fcd62d05dbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754068373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/b3e8029123041c5d9942a817da5c7fcd62d05dbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754068373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"This game contains intense violence, blood and gore involving infected creatures and mutated monsters. Player discretion is advised.\""},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.poster.avif?t=1754068373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/855a8622ec6e62c183935b97578ea7b1.webm?t=1754068373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blackout</strong> is a hardcore co-op shooter set in the Earth Federation, now overrun by special infected creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From secret laboratories to deep underground high-speed subway stations, you are deployed as near-future special forces to key Federation facilities.   <br>Leave no infected behind\u2014eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4-Player Co-op Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870010/extras/29bc7b6d693765da434bf2529105506f